[a|] byte means: @intrinsic("type", "int", 8)

[a|] thirty two bit integer means: @intrinsic("type", "int", 32)

[a|] pointer to pointee means: @intrinsic("add pointer depth", pointee)

the size of measured means: @intrinsic("size of", measured)

function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

class:
    patterns:
        [a|] padded value
    members:
        data as a pointer to a byte
        length as a thirty two bit integer

ignore @intrinsic("variadic call", "libc", "printf", a thirty two bit integer, 1, "%lld\n", the size of a padded value)
